<title>SPAIN: Revised Spanish M4 figures for December.</title>
<headline>Revised Spanish M4 figures for December.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain, which earlier on Thursday released provisional M4 figures for January, subsequently published revised data as follows:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		    JAN 97     DEC 96     JAN 96</p>
<p> M4 pct rise			5.2	  8.4 (8.7)  4.8</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise    18.4	  5.3 (7.4) 10.7 NOTE -</p>
<p>January data are provisional. December data is revised, with previous figures in brackets. Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
